  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef has a permutationpermutationpermutation P1,P2,…,PNP_1, P_2, \\ldots, P_NP1​,P2​,…,PN​ of integers 111 through NNN. He needs you to find the value of the sum\nS=∑i=1N∑j=iNgetMin (i,j)  ∧  getMax (i,j) ,S = \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{N} \\sum\\limits_{j=i}^{N} \\mathrm{getMin}\\,(i, j) \\; \\wedge \\; \\mathrm{getMax}\\,(i, j) \\,,S=i=1∑N​j=i∑N​getMin(i,j)∧getMax(i,j),\nwhere ∧\\wedge∧ denotes the bitwise AND operation and\ngetMin (i,j)=min (Pi,Pi+1,…,Pj−1,Pj) ,\\mathrm{getMin}\\,(i, j) = \\mathrm{min}\\,(P_i, P_{i+1}, \\ldots, P_{j-1}, P_j) \\,,getMin(i,j)=min(Pi​,Pi+1​,…,Pj−1​,Pj​),\ngetMax (i,j)=max (Pi,Pi+1,…,Pj−1,Pj) .\\mathrm{getMax}\\,(i, j) = \\mathrm{max}\\,(P_i, P_{i+1}, \\ldots, P_{j-1}, P_j) \\,.getMax(i,j)=max(Pi​,Pi+1​,…,Pj−1​,Pj​).",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤21 \\le T \\le 21≤T≤2",
      "1≤N≤1051 \\le N \\le 10^51≤N≤105",
      "1≤Pi≤N1 \\le P_i \\le N1≤Pi​≤N for each valid iii",
      "P1,P2,…,PNP_1, P_2, \\ldots, P_NP1​,P2​,…,PN​ is a permutation"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "The first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains a single integer NNN.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers P1,P2,…,PNP_1, P_2, \\ldots, P_NP1​,P2​,…,PN​.",
    "outputFormat": "For each test case, print a single line containing one integer SSS.",
